Package: anchorCorrectR
Type: Package
Title: Anchor-Based Batch Correction for Gene Expression Data
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("María", "Rivas-Torrubia",
           email = "maria.rivas@genyo.es",
           role = "aut"),
    person("Ana", "Brescia-Zapata",
           email = "ana.brescia@genyo.es",
           role = "aut"),
    person("Guillermo", "Barturen",
           email = "gbarturen@ugr.es",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Performs anchor-based batch correction of gene expression
    matrices when replicate samples are observed across technical batches.
    Location-shift correction supports mean or median centers, with additional
    ridge and anchor-aware ComBat methods. Correction is computed on the log
    scale and returned in the same scale as the input, with utilities for
    assessment and quality control.
